[Report : PW Detailed Expense List]
Use : DSP Template
Form : PW DE List Form
Title : "Detailed Expense Report (PesoWise)"

[Form : PW DE List Form]
Set : PW Active Title : "Detailed Expense Report"
Part : PW Shell Header Part, PW DE Grid Part, PW DE Footer Part
Height : 100% Screen

[Part : PW DE Grid Part]
Lines : PW DE Col Head Line, PW DE Data Line
Repeat : PW DE Data Line : PW Detailed Latest
Scroll : Both
Common Border : Yes

[Line : PW DE Col Head Line]
