Border : Thin Top

[Line : PW DE Footer Line]
Field : PW DE Foot Count

[Field : PW DE Foot Count]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "All 20 PesoWise detailed-expense report fields. Scroll horizontally and vertically; Enter opens details."
Width : 80

[Key : PW DE Line Enter]
Key : Enter
Action : CALL : PW DE Show Detail

[Function : PW DE Show Detail]
01 : SET : SV PW Ledger Name : $Name
02 : Display : PW Detailed Expense Detail

[Report : PW Detailed Expense Detail]
Use : DSP Template
Form : PW DE Detail Form
Title : "Expense Details"

[Form : PW DE Detail Form]
Part : PW DE Det Head, PW DE Det Body
Height : 100% Screen
Width : 100% Screen

[Part : PW DE Det Head]
Lines : PW DE Det Title, PW DE Det Hint
[Line : PW DE Det Title]
Field : PW DE Det Title F
[Field : PW DE Det Title F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Detailed Expense Details"
Style : PW Title Style
Full Width : Yes
[Line : PW DE Det Hint]
Field : PW DE Det Hint F
[Field : PW DE Det Hint F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Press Esc to return to the list."
Style : PW Subtitle Style
Full Width : Yes

[Part : PW DE Det Body]
Part : PW DE Det Block
Repeat : PW DE Det Block : PW Selected Ledger One
Scroll : Vertical

